      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present to the market this stunning and ideally located, TURN KEY, three bedroom, three bathroom semi-detached property in the popular Parkleigh Row, Seven Mills, Clondalkin. This sought-after location is within walking distance of a host of local amenities such as restaurants, cafes, shops, schools, parks and recreational facilities. Parkleigh Row is part of the brand new Seven Mills development of Clondalkin, a connected, walkable neighbourhood where homes, green spaces and transport links come together to make everyday life easier. With 12 parks, 2.4km of canal frontage, 12.5km of walking and cycling routes and 225 acres of green space woven throughout the area. Transport wise, the development is situated between both Kilshoge and Fonthill Train stations, with just a 15 minute journey to the City Centre whilst the M50 is easily accessible by car.\n\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 110 sq.m can be found here and briefly consists of; Entrance hall, guest wc, fully fitted kitchen/dining room, utility room, living room, two double bedrooms, including master with ensuite, one single bedroom and a main family bathroom. Externally you have a beautifully maintained, SOUTH/WEST facing rear garden which benefits from patio, shed and side access to the front where you will find a garden and parking for two cars.\n\nNo. 2 comes to the market in superb condition throughout and is truly presented as a turn key home. This property was built in 2024 and comes with an exceptionally high energy rating of A2 meaning the property is eligible for a green mortgage. Due to the exceptional presentation of this property, we know it will be extremely popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest or arrange a viewing!\n\nFeatures;\n- c. 110 sq.m\n- 3 BED / 3 BATH\n- A2 BER rating\n- Still within new build home warranty\n- Beautifully maintained west facing rear garden\n- Turn key condition\n- Modern layout\n- Flooded with natural light\n- Parking for two cars\n- Ample built in storage space\n- All essential amenities in close proximity\n- Creche and multiple playgrounds within the development\n- Further plans for commercial and educational facilities within the development\n- Kilshoge and Fonthill train stations within easy reach\n- Direct access onto the M50\n- Ideal for first time buyers, families thinking of trading up and investors\n- Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections:\nD22 P6F8"
      },
      {
